--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -5,11 +5,16 @@ A tiny in-memory todo list used from the command line.
 ## Usage
 
 ```
-todo add <text>          Add a task
+todo add <text> [--priority=low|normal|high]
+                         Add a task (priority defaults to normal)
 todo done <id>           Mark a task done
-todo list [--all]        List open tasks (or all tasks)
+todo list [--all] [--sort=priority]
+                         List open tasks (or all tasks), optionally high
+                         priority first
 ```
 
+Listed tasks show their priority: `[!]` high, `[ ]` normal, `[-]` low.
+
 ## Development
 
 Run `npm test`.
